chore: release v2.4.1

Fix JavaScript errors and excessive connection logging

Changes:
- Fixed JavaScript syntax error in network-pi.html
- Fixed JavaScript syntax error in prune-pi.html
- Reduced excessive connection logs in docker-logs action
- Fixed connection pooling to reuse existing connections

Fixes:
- JavaScript 'Unexpected string' error in network and prune actions
- Excessive 'Connecting to server' logs every few seconds
- Unnecessary reconnections when already connected
- Connection pooling not working properly in logs action

